"11. Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD) / فرط الحركة وتشتت الانتباه\nDefinition: Neurodevelopmental disorder characterized by a persistent pattern of inattention and/or hyperactivity-impulsivity that interferes with functioning or development. Keywords: ADHD, inattention, hyperactivity, impulsivity, focus, تشتت الانتباه, فرط الحركة, تركيز, نقص الانتباه."
